---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
const title = "Business Development Executive";
const description = "Crayonweb is hiring a Business Development Executive to identify opportunities, build client relationships, and drive sales growth in our IT services.";
const canonical = "https://stage.woodwolfdigital.com/business-development-executive/";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} type="website">
  <div class="container" style="padding:3rem 1rem">
    <h1>Business Development Executive</h1>
    <p>Crayonweb is hiring a Business Development Executive to identify opportunities, build client relationships, and drive sales growth in our IT services.</p>
    <h2>Job Details</h2>
    <ul><li>Vacancy: No of Vacancies: 01</li></ul>
<ul>
      <li>Location: Bhavnagar-Gujarat</li>
      <li>Date: 29 August 2025</li>
      <li>Job Type: Full Time (On Site)</li>
      <li>Working Hours: 10 AM to 07 PM</li>
      <li>Working Days: Weekly 6 days (Mon to Sat)</li>
      <li>Salary: As Per Eligibility</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Unlock New Opportunities with Us</h2>
    <p>CrayonWeb is seeking a driven and enthusiastic Business Development Executive to join our growing IT team. In this role, you will be at the forefront of building client relationships, identifying new business opportunities, and promoting our digital solutions across industries. You will collaborate closely with our technical experts, marketing strategists, and project managers to craft tailored solutions that deliver measurable value to clients. As a Business Development Executive, you will engage in market research, lead generation, and client interactions, turning prospects into long-term partnerships. Your responsibilities will include presenting proposals, negotiating contracts, and contributing to revenue growth. With strong communication and interpersonal skills, you will play a key role in expanding CrayonWeb's presence and helping businesses embrace digital transformation. At CrayonWeb, we believe in innovation, collaboration, and professional growth. This role gives you the opportunity to work on diverse projects, explore new markets, and develop your expertise in IT solutions. Our supportive culture values initiative and fresh ideas, ensuring your efforts are recognized while you grow with us.</p>
    <h2>requirements</h2>
    <p>Experience: At least 1 year</p>
    <h3>Additional Requirements</h3>
<h4>Business &amp; Communication Skills</h4><ul><li>Strong verbal and written communication skills with the ability to present ideas clearly</li><li>Proven ability in lead generation, client acquisition, and relationship management</li><li>Excellent negotiation and persuasion skills to close deals effectively</li><li>Ability to understand client needs and translate them into tailored IT solutions</li></ul>
    <h4>Analytical &amp; Strategic Skills</h4><ul><li>Market research and competitor analysis to identify growth opportunities</li><li>Strong business acumen and goal-oriented approach</li><li>Ability to prepare proposals, business presentations, and sales reports</li><li>Data-driven mindset to evaluate performance and optimize strategies</li></ul>
    <h4>Preferred Experience (a plus)</h4><ul><li>Experience in IT services, SaaS, or digital solutions sales</li><li>Familiarity with CRM tools (HubSpot, Zoho, Salesforce, etc.)</li><li>Knowledge of web, mobile, and enterprise technologies to align solutions with client needs</li></ul>
    <h2>Email your CV</h2>
    <p>Send your CV to the given email <a href="mailto:hr@crayonwebstudio.com">hr@crayonwebstudio.com</a></p>
    <h2>Apply Position</h2>
<form>
      <p><label>Your first name<br /><input type="text" name="first_name" /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your last name<br /><input type="text" name="last_name" /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your email address *<br /><input type="email" name="email" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your phone number *<br /><input type="tel" name="phone" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Working Experience *<br /><input type="text" name="experience" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Upload CV *<br /><input type="file" name="cv" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your message<br /><textarea name="message" rows="5"></textarea></label></p>
      <p><button type="submit">Submit</button></p>
    </form>
    <p>Note: this form is front end only on this staging site, so nothing is sent. Email your CV to <a href="mailto:hr@crayonwebstudio.com">hr@crayonwebstudio.com</a> instead.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
